{"parse": {"title": "4TH-07", "pageid": 6098, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/4TH-06\" title=\"4TH-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">4TH-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/4TH-08\" title=\"4TH-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">4TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B5.B7.E7.9B.97.E5.AE.A3.E8.A8.80\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"海盗宣言\">海盗宣言</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 海盗宣言</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Pirate's Declaration</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>别<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>么<span class=\"color-value\"></span>早<span class=\"color-value\"></span>切<span class=\"color-value\"></span>断<span class=\"color-value\"></span>电<span class=\"color-value\"></span>源<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>笨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>蛋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>错<span class=\"color-value\"></span>过<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>首<span class=\"color-value\"></span>歌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10407</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuidatang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuidatang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接待员在确认共融院新提交上来的名单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>副会长正向此处走来。她很少亲自来取文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但事程追踪器提示，副会长将有85%的概率需要这份名单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>代表人候选名单出来了吗？给我看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>好的，请您稍等。马上就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是的。感谢拉普拉斯科算中心的发明，让一切都如此可控，高效，有逻辑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接待员的手灵活地在键盘上敲击，她将比以往更快地找到文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突然，她定住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>呃，这个灯怎么亮起来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她几乎是迟疑地，目瞪口呆地转过身去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“哔滋滋——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>墙壁上出现了巨幕投影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>粗糙的光将苹果投在墙壁上，如同一个硕大的红色警告符。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>歪歪扭扭的英文小字显现在苹果下方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>内容则相当刺眼：“宣战！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>警告，警告！全员都有，给我听好了，基金会已经被我们占领！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我们的谈判条件是，解除监禁，释放维尔汀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>限你们在三日内放人，否则——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接待员一脸惊恐地切断了电源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人来人往的走廊一时变得分外安静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>副、副——副会长……我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>这个不是——我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>怎么了，打印机出问题了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>没有。没有……哦，对，代表人候选名单……在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她面色苍白地递上名单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>谢谢，我正需要这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康斯坦丁抬头望了一眼墙壁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骚动的影像已经消失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>让你见笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>他们也有发声的权利，这正是双方达成共识的必经之路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>我们会解决这个问题的，别担心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她笑了笑。四周的人又恢复了生气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>不过……年久失修的投影设备还是不要用了，总是容易出现意外事故，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>明白！我现在就撤掉这些中转器……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她几乎是跳着站起来敬了个礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康斯坦丁转身离开了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlinguangchang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlinguangchang2\"><img alt=\"senlinguangchang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-senlinguangchang2.png/600px-Cg-senlinguangchang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-senlinguangchang2.png/900px-Cg-senlinguangchang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-senlinguangchang2.png/1200px-Cg-senlinguangchang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>气死我了！气死我了！他们竟然切断了我的电源——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗还有好多宣言没有发表呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>懦夫！胆小鬼！伪君子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>嗯嗯，我很赞同。而且，不听别人说完话就挂掉电话，也是非常不合礼节的做法！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>苏芙比小姐，这个不是电话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>当然，这不重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>不论如何，我们都将最关键的谈判条件传达给他们了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>相信他们会给我们应有的回应的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哼……我只是想把握住这个表达态度的机会……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>入侵基金会总部的公共广播，这可是几百年才能等到的大乐子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>唉，要是能再来首《You Can't Win》收尾就更完美了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我们可以在这附近再找找看，也许能找到其他的广播设备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>不过，APPLe某不推荐频繁挑衅基金会的行为。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>眼下更重要的是巡视周围的环境，以防遭到守卫的埋伏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>槲寄生小姐正独自一人在楼下设置鹿砦障碍，说不定她也需要我们的帮忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嗯……好吧，你说的有道理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗……就暂时推迟解放基金会的计划了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她依依不舍地从收音设备上收回目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>除了放置鹿砦，我们还有什么事情要做吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>还有许多事情要处理，船长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>确认水源，转移必要设备，储备足够的粮食，设置森林的多重防线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>还需要安排值日日程，确保大家在箱子里休憩时，能有人在箱子外驻守。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>嗯，我这里还有槲寄生小姐送的西红柿和土豆的种子，我们得在箱子里种起来，才能保证一直有东西吃哦～！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>唔……西红柿，土豆……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>都是在胃里荡不起一丁点油花的东西啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>以前在海上流浪的时候，每天至少还能吃上一条烤海鲈鱼呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哎，不知道维尔汀在病房里吃的是什么……会不会肚子饿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咕……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哦！差点忘了X送的一箱好东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>有那堆玩意儿，我们肯定能多撑几天！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>苏芙比，APPLe先生，你们先下楼吧，等我把纸箱搬下去，就跟你们会合！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>好的呀！我们就在入口那里等你，要注意安全哦！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "4TH-07"}}